      Version {{ release.version }} — free and open source
    </p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">All your databases, one window.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Downpick connects to PostgreSQL, SQL Server, and MongoDB, shows you what's in them, and runs your queries. It installs on your machine, keeps your passwords in an encrypted vault, and asks nothing of you beyond a password.</p>
